# Kremer-Grest bead-spring melt, planar Couette flow by SLLOD (flow x, gradient y, vorticity z)
# usage: lmp -in in.shear -var rate 0.05 -var tag r005
units lj
atom_style bond
boundary p p p
special_bonds fene
neighbor 0.4 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 1 check yes
bond_style fene
pair_style lj/cut 1.12246152962189
pair_modify shift yes
read_data kg_equil.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (13.300573 13.300573 13.300573)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  2000 atoms
  reading velocities ...
  2000 velocities
  scanning bonds ...
  1 = max bonds/atom
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (13.300573 13.300573 13.300573)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading bonds ...
  1900 bonds
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
  special bond factors lj:    0        1        1       
  special bond factors coul:  0        1        1       
     2 = max # of 1-2 neighbors
     2 = max # of special neighbors
  special bonds CPU = 0.000 seconds
  read_data CPU = 0.036 seconds
bond_coeff 1 30.0 1.5 1.0 1.0
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 1.12246152962189
change_box all triclinic
Changing box ...
  triclinic box = (0 0 0) to (13.300573 13.300573 13.300573) with tilt (0 0 0)
velocity all create 1.0 ${seed} dist gaussian
velocity all create 1.0 11 dist gaussian
timestep 0.005
compute T all temp/deform
compute P all pressure T
fix def all deform 1 xy erate ${rate} remap v
fix def all deform 1 xy erate 0.02 remap v
fix th all nvt/sllod temp 1.0 1.0 0.5
fix_modify th temp T
fix av all ave/time 20 5 100 c_P[1] c_P[2] c_P[3] c_P[4] c_T file stress_${tag}.dat
fix av all ave/time 20 5 100 c_P[1] c_P[2] c_P[3] c_P[4] c_T file stress_r002.dat
thermo 20000
thermo_modify temp T
run ${nsteps}
run 300000
